        "type": "text",
        "text": "QueryNest is a multimodal document intelligence system. It ingests complex documents such as PDF, images, tables and equations, then enables hybrid retrieval and citation-based answering. The core pipeline is: parse, index, hybrid retrieval, rerank, context construction, and final answer generation.",
        "bbox": [
            124,
            146,
            848,
            206
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Hybrid retrieval in QueryNest combines Dense vector retrieval, BM25 keyword retrieval, and LightRAG knowledge-graph retrieval. All candidate hits are fused with Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF), deduplicated, and finally reranked before the context window is assembled.",
